---
manual: builtins.const.REVISION
lines: [611, 611]
testability: api
display: any
ledger: L3
expect: fail
reason: "Lacci runs git rev-parse HEAD in the app's working directory, so REVISION is blank when the app lives outside the Scarpe checkout"
----------- app code
Shoes.app { para "revision #{Shoes::REVISION}" }
----------- test code
assert Shoes.const_defined?(:REVISION, false), "Shoes::REVISION is defined"
refute_nil Shoes::REVISION, "it names the build's revision"
refute_empty Shoes::REVISION.to_s.strip, "and is not blank"
